  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Positive ions move towards the right in a copper wire. The wire is placed between two magnets as shown on the diagram.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the direction of the electromagnetic force on the wire?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">Towards the top of the page.</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">Towards the bottom of the page.</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">Perpendicular to and out of the page.</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">Perpendicular to and into the page.</li>\n</ol>"
